ent-tickets.aspx","source_title":"Student Tickets | Monmouth University Athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2019-12-19","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For ticketed events, students must show and scan a valid Monmouth student ID; others may need a ticket.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lois-blonder-sculpture-garden","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Lois Blonder Sculpture Garden","title":"Lois Blonder Sculpture Garden","subtitle":"Outdoor art garden beside the 600 Art Building","notes":"Take the walking paths slowly and use the sculptures, pond, and plantings as prompts for a short outdoor art or photography break.","short_summary":"A campus art garden with walking paths, a koi pond, plants, and sculptures from Lois Blonder’s collection.","evidence_claim":"Monmouth reports that the Lois Blonder Sculpture Garden beside the 600 Art Building includes a koi pond, walking paths, plants, and an array of sculptures.","source_url":"https://www.monmouth.edu/magazine/a-living-legacy/","source_title":"A Living Legacy | Monmouth Magazine","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2019-06-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor conditions and any temporary campus restrictions may affect access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"erlanger-gardens","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Erlanger Gardens","title":"Erlanger Gardens","subtitle":"Garden grounds at the Great Hall","notes":"Walk the fountains and portico beside the Great Hall, then use the garden for a quiet study or relaxation pause when no event is using it.","short_summary":"A landscaped Great Hall garden with fountains and a portico, described by the University as a place for events, studying, and relaxation.","evidence_claim":"Monmouth’s campus map describes Erlanger Garden